WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.900
Timeline of foreign interference.

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:12.037
From 2004, CSIS warned successive governments about PRC interference targeting Canadian institutions and political figures.

00:00:12.037 --> 00:00:16.000
Leaked documents in 2022 revealed the scope.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.075
Despite multiple elections affected, the government's initial response was to investigate the leaks rather than the interference itself.
